  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup teriyaki sauce",
    "0.25 cup lemon juice",
    "2 teaspoons minced fresh garlic",
    "2 teaspoons sesame oil",
    "4 skinless, boneless chicken breast halves"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/awxxgdcUuHHcFjNbYaVZbGgNyqY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17784-easy-grilled-chicken-teriyaki-VAT-005-step-01-6fd0ef53629941219e549f0211483eca.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17784/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk teriyaki sauce, lemon juice, garlic, and sesame oil together in a bowl",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/756oNeeM4LaB3NeZ_5Y7aAs4RW8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17784-easy-grilled-chicken-teriyaki-VAT-006-step-02-01whiskingaction-52f9594ea3b541b8a16a4f67973714de.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17784/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour marinade into a resealable plastic bag. Add chicken, coat with marinade, squeeze out excess air, and seal the bag. Marinate in the refrigerator for at least 1 hour to overnight, turning every so often.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/H6lJ98aTIEZvXRpeZL6O67xkiDk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17784-easy-grilled-chicken-teriyaki-VAT-007-step-03-6c6804880c56454090ab2237bcf81b85.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17784/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "When ready to cook, preheat an outdoor grill for high heat and lightly oil the grate. Remove chicken from marinade and shake off excess. Discard any remaining marinade.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CcJYQ4fjDOsIh9WgxDQLyANhkyk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17784-easy-grilled-chicken-teriyaki-VAT-008-step-04-9a26456ea4694f298e22eccf5d7d8499.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17784/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook chicken breasts on the preheated grill until no longer pink in the center and the juices run clear, 6 to 8 minutes per side. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wzxFaJRz8WC-pu8zoB8nBCFmhzY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17784-easy-grilled-chicken-teriyaki-VAT-009-step-05-01-046d8ee5229e4a9d851f4a4d5f2d3e63.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17784/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RddEz0At3MV41n6Azw_0LOT5mgI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17784-easy-grilled-chicken-teriyaki-VAT-003-4x3-02scalliongarnish-58802f9dd3b145f99b374515e3d66db9.jpg"
